      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll start by reading the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has unused imports and an unused helper method. I'll write a cleaner version with minimal imports, no dead code, and comments that explain the non-obvious behavior being verified.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes unused imports and the dead `assertToStrings` helper, splits the test into clear Arrange/Act/Assert sections, and adds comments explaining the non-obvious contract: that adding an option to an `OptionGroup` strips its `required` flag and removes it from the required options list."
